OL,3,GNEWSAWork begins on new square to
OL,4,Areplace shopping centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to transform an old shopping
OL,7,Fcentre into a new open air square has
OL,8,Fbegun.
OL,10,FThe Clarendon Centre first opened on
OL,11,FCornmarket in Oxford city centre in
OL,12,F1984 but in recent years had fallen
OL,13,Finto disrepair with many units left
OL,14,Fempty.
OL,16,FBut developers Goldmoney Properties
OL,17,Frecently had plans approved by Oxford
OL,18,FCity Council to demolish the centre and
OL,19,Freplace it with a new square.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
