OL,3,GNEWSAWork begins on new square to
OL,4,Areplace shopping centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoy Sebag, owner of Goldmoney
OL,7,FProperties and founder of Clarendon
OL,8,FSquare, said he hoped the area would
OL,9,Fbecome "a part of everyday life in
OL,10,FOxford".
